  "title": "sharkd: wait for child processes",
  "description": "sharkd creates a fork for each connected client but these child\nprocesses were never waited for. This leaves zombie processes and\neventually prevents sharkd from creating new forks.\nThis is fixed by waiting for exited children before forking.",
